  - id: the_immanuel_sign
    displayName: The Immanuel Sign
    flavorText: 'Though Ahaz refuses to ask for any sign, the LORD gives one anyway:
      a virgin shall conceive and bear a son, and call his name Immanuel, God with
      us.'
    tierType: 1
    purpose: 'A sign given to the house of David despite Ahaz''s refusal to ask for
      one: a child to be named Immanuel (''God with us''), assuring God''s continued
      presence with Judah even under threat of invasion.'
    deliveredByManagerId: isaiah
