  - id: wonderful_counsellor
    displayName: Wonderful Counsellor
    flavorText: A child is born, a son given, and his name is called Wonderful, Counsellor,
      The mighty God, The everlasting Father, The Prince of Peace, to reign forever
      on David's throne.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Announces a coming child/son upon whose shoulder government rests, given
      a string of throne-names, who will establish David's throne 'with judgment
      and with justice' forever.
    deliveredByManagerId: isaiah
