  - id: the_sixfold_woe
    displayName: The Sixfold Woe
    flavorText: Across six oracles, Isaiah cries 'Woe' against pride, hidden rebellion,
      and Judah's trust in Egypt instead of the Holy One of Israel.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Six prophetic denunciations, each opening with 'Woe,' pronounced across
      chapters 28-33 against pride, hidden rebellion, and trust in political alliances
      instead of the LORD.
    deliveredByManagerId: isaiah
    managerId: six_woes
